\n      ],\n      \"answered_preview\": \"The next entry comparison is concrete. Node.ProposeConfChange says changes are dropped unless the leader has certainty no prior unapplied configuration change remains; Node.Advance permits acknowledgment while commands are still being appli…\",\n      \"ref_ids\": [\n        \"src_node_application_contract\",\n        \"src_node_status_apply\",\n        \"src_membership_contract\",\n        \"src_campaign_conf_test\",\n        \"src_ready_accept\",\n        \"src_raw_advance\",\n        \"src_leader_proposal\",\n        \"e4baebb7670c403395463e42d0844956\"\n      ],\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"selections\",\n        \"match\": {\n          \"operation_id\": \"826474aeed4f44eb813dd920d74f27ea\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"operation_id\": \"5de54877903c4de3b1de183e103e433b\",\n      \"action\": \"explore\",\n      \"candidate_ids\": [],\n      \"answered_preview\": \"The source distinguishes Node early-Advance permission from the stricter wording of RawNode.Advance. The prepared experiment uses Node directly, so no lower-level permission is silently substituted. It also separates internal Applied, actua…\",\n      \"ref_ids\": [\n        \"src_node_application_contract\",\n        \"src_node_status_apply\",\n        \"src_ready_accept\",\n        \"src_raw_advance\",\n        \"src_leader_proposal\",\n        \"src_membership_contract\"\n      ],\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"selections\",\n        \"match\": {\n          \"operation_id\": \"5de54877903c4de3b1de183e103e433b\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"feedback\": {\n        \"ref_ids\": [\n          \"src_node_application_contract\",\n          \"src_node_status_apply\",\n          \"src_ready_accept\",\n          \"src_raw_advance\",\n          \"src_leader_proposal\",\n          \"src_membership_contract\"\n        ],\n        \"answered\": \"The source distinguishes Node early-Advance permission from the stricter wording of RawNode.Advance. The prepared experiment uses Node directly, so no lower-level permission is silently substituted. It also separates internal Applied, actual returned ApplyConfChange calls, encoded second-entry type and commitment; none is inferred from ProposeConfChange returning nil.\",\n        \"remaining\": [\n          \"Observe the three policy outcomes in the clean-copy execution, then retain the precise contract applicability gap or formulate a sourced scoped responsibility if justified.\"\n        ],\n        \"understanding\": \"unchanged\",\n        \"rationale\": \"This single comparison isolates the completion signal consumed by pendingConfIndex guards while preserving actual producer history and inter-Ready application order. No second arbitrary schedule is needed before reading its outcome.\",\n        \"question_updates\": {}\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pending_work\": [],\n  \"current\": {\n    \"phase\": \"executed\",\n    \"operation_id\": \"5de54877903c4de3b1de183e103e433b\",\n    \"action\": \"explore\"\n  },\n  \"latest_decision\": {\n    \"operation_id\": \"5de54877903c4de3b1de183e103e433b\",\n    \"action\": \"explore\",\n    \"record\": {\n      \"path\": \"state.json\",\n      \"collection\": \"selections\",\n      \"match\": {\n        \"operation_id\": \"5de54877903c4de3b1de183e103e433b\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"stop\": {},\n  \"stop_reason\": \"Not started\",\n  \"explorations\": [\n    {\n      \"operation_id\": \"ce088ac9c931490aa3551e39e28b158f\",\n      \"submission\": \"submissions/ce088ac9c931490aa3551e39e28b158f/accepted.json\",\n      \"question\": \"Under AsyncStorageWrites with ordered local workers, does an actual later-term vote request followed by old and then current append completions leave and then clear the follower unstable prefix, even when the current-term storage request co…\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Construct a single history through public RawNode methods using three actual raft instances. Bootstrap each Storage from the same term-1 committed snapshot, run a real term-2 election, then replicate a proposal to node 2 while delaying its …\",\n      \"ref_ids\": [],\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src_async_delivery\",\n        \"src_unstable_role\"\n      ],\n      \"inputs\": [\n        \"submissions/ce088ac9c931490aa3551e39e28b158f/inputs/storage_explore_test.go\"\n      ],\n      \"executions\": [\n        {\n          \"check_id\": \"094ea077ebb340d39d82022bc7e733ad\",\n          \"status\": \"completed\",\n          \"exit_code\": 0,\n          \"started_at\": \"2026-10-02T08:34:46.060669+00:00\",\n          \"ended_at\": \"2026-10-02T08:34:59.249239+00:00\",\n          \"record\": \"logs/094ea077ebb340d39d82022bc7e733ad/check.json\",\n          \"stdout\": \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-02_16-15-15-etcd_raft-real-run/logs/094ea077ebb340d39d82022bc7e733ad/stdout.log\",\n          \"stderr\": \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-02_16-15-15-etcd_raft-real-run/logs/094ea077ebb340d39d82022bc7e733ad/stderr.log\",\n          \"artifacts\": [\n            \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-02_16-15-15-etcd_raft-real-run/experiments/b14df3dbfb2647fc82d19a72e8e2b133/workspace-delta/manifest.json\",\n            \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-02_16-15-15-etcd_raft-real-run/experiments/b14df3dbfb2647fc82d19a72e8e2b133/workspace-outcome/manifest.json\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"feedback\": [\n        {\n          \"operation_id\": \"a37d283ba41d4332b8e5eab54bb3d19d\",\n          \"submission\": \"submissions/a37d283ba41d4332b8e5eab54bb3d19d/accepted.json\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"operation_id\": \"4d3f28aea9c74c2c820a4717a7b643c9\",\n          \"submission\": \"submissions/4d3f28aea9c74c2c820a4717a7b643c9/accepted.json\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"operation_id\": \"a37d2